#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:5 797cf581ddbe4d41bf4e9e29a61b115f
msgid "SkyRocket Software"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:7 e731fdf39e874f61a2b6bcf05ee799a6
msgid ""
"the drone shipped with a custom version of ArduPilot (Copter) which is "
"close to Copter-3.5 but now additional features (notch filter, etc).  "
"`GitHub repo is here <https://github.com/SkyRocketToys/ardupilot>`__ in "
"the skyviper-stable branch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:8 99279425b3bd48c8b9090df610d5fca9
msgid ""
"firmware source for the video board is `here "
"<https://github.com/SkyRocketToys/Sonix>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:9 5b5300ce185c40b7bb0f849952719a8b
msgid ""
"`APWeb <https://github.com/ArduPilot/APWeb>`__ (a tiny open source web "
"server) runs on the drone and allows easy calibration, modification of "
"parameters, uploading firmware to both the drone and transmitter, "
"downloading log files, pictures and videos."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:10 ff3a6b4741484382832d3dc9b5897da1
msgid ""
"the transmitter has a relatively low powered STM8 processor running open "
"source software written by Tridge (incorporates some code from "
"Paparazzi).  `Github repo is here "
"<https://github.com/SkyRocketToys/STM8TX>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:11 b1cc5553f1d041e9a831942a0297126a
msgid "live video can be viewed through a SkyRocket app or Mission Planner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:14 33d8b224cbc74bf792d769dab2adef17
msgid "Uploading alternative firmware"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:19 0077b59e03e4413eaa450fa403c78664
msgid ""
"The instructions below describe how to uploading alternative firmware to "
"the drone.  Normally we recommend users stick with the official firmware "
"from SkyRocket but for those interested in trying the very latest "
"features from ArduPilot, participating in beta testing or for those who "
"wish to create their own custom firmware, these instructions are useful."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:21 25bd3cc86f644f14823deb964d8bf9c0
msgid ""
"Note that alternative firmwares are use **at your own risk** and probably"
" void your warranty."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:23 99df33caa1594d00a4b0525e2e982883
msgid "**Which firmware to use?**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:25 8b0d896fb0484efcab36b3e9a2e75db9
msgid "As of early 2018 there are two versions of the firmware available:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:27 c8a450c4b64c41c09da7cc377c0abca4
msgid ""
"the `official firmware from skyrocket <http://firmware.sky-"
"viper.com/latest/>`__ (see file ending with \".abin\") is the safest "
"firmware to use."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:28 c08e813a5c764235826f8549d5813735
msgid ""
"the `latest firmware from ArduPilot "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/latest/skyviper-v2450/>`__ "
"includes some new features (i.e. :ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>`) but is "
"also missing some features (i.e. ability to control vehicle during RTL)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:30 d8bfdc57efe14fc194fe3029b24cbdf9
msgid "**Uploading using the SD card**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:32 6fb3d82f24d741e3b6dcbe4e367c1fc1
msgid ""
"powerdown the drone and remove the SD card from the back of the skyviper "
"and insert into your PC (an SD card adapter may be required)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:33 571f3c92443d4bfcb9eb98afc00ef484
msgid ""
"copy the firmware into the top directory of the SD card and then rename "
"it to \"flight_fw.abin\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:38 fbb4cf921f5b45c69a39767b96ef56b3
msgid "place the sd card back into the drone and power up the vehicle"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:39 a20a351bde7148f089a31c7a38637b9e
msgid ""
"after about a minute the LEDs should flash and the vehicle should "
"reconnect to the transmitter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:41 2f640bd1cc364e4a805ce17b123429fe
msgid "**Uploading using APWeb**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:43 a504053a94f84975ab43f1c42c7dc33a
msgid ""
"from your PC, connect to the SkyViper wifi access point (normally called "
"\"SKYVIPERGPS-xxxxxx\", password is \"vipergps\")"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:44 3ed995dee82a48e5a0c9eb85def13010
msgid ""
"open a web browser to ``http://192.168.99.1`` and click the **Upgrade "
"Firmware** link"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:49 3cc9c6ccb95a42e6baf38f163d548691
msgid ""
"in the \"Upgrade ArduPilot Firmware\" section, push the \"Browse\" button"
" and select the \\*.abin file downloaded above"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:50 54bf12677f574b878e5a8662c65d94ab
msgid ""
"push the \"Upload File\" button and wait a minute or two.  The green bar "
"at the top of the web page should crawl from left to right and then the "
"autopilot should reboot and reconnect to the transmitter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:57 6b36ae85f17f4023983e75b37411d155
msgid ""
"After a firmware upgrade it may be necessary to perform an accelerometer "
"calibration.  This can be done from the web interface's \"Calibration\" "
"page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:59 aecfef58ce50485bad5c376ee59f7ffd
msgid "**When things go wrong**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:61 8d9261e25cbd42f18f916cdae1fdc78a
msgid ""
"If the drone becomes unresponsive or will not connect to the transmitter "
"or the wifi access point does not appear, don't worry, it is nearly "
"impossible to \"brick\" the skyviper.  Try these steps:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:63 892d72b98f4145c1ac02d201e8a6c9ad
msgid ""
"download the official skyrocket firmware from `here <http://firmware.sky-"
"viper.com/latest/>`__ (look for the file ending with \".abin\")."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:64 72c2b54c74e243e89cbdd24012b0c1c2
msgid ""
"use the \"Uploading using the SD card\" method above to upload the "
"firmware to the drone"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:65 55fca62097364ce9ac3113d7840bb3be
msgid ""
"if this does not work, try asking for help in the `SkyViper section of "
"the ArduPilot forum "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/arducopter/skyviper>`__"
msgstr ""

